{
  "comment": "Whether someone has brought an agent in. The app looks at every computer that is online and, for Graff, Claude Code and Codex (OpenAI), takes the best status across them: ready (installed and switched on; an absent `installed` or `enabled` reads as true, as in the engine), off (installed but switched off), canInstall (not installed, but it can be installed from that computer's Settings > Agents), missing (not installed, or not reported at all). Other agents (Grok, Cursor and the rest) never count. State is noComputer with no computer online, ready when any of the three is ready, noAgent otherwise. `devices` lists, in order, the online computers at that agent's best status; with no computer online every agent is missing with no devices.",
  "agents": [
    "graff",
    "claude-code",
    "codex"
  ],
  "downloadUrl": "https://harness.codegraff.com/#downloads",
  "cases": [
